SUMMARY:Deadline: WHATIF: five-month digital art residency at NODE Studio N
 YC (USD 25\,000 stipend)
DESCRIPTION:WHATIF is a five-month residency at NODE Studio NYC for people 
 who want to pursue one burning question through digital art and technology
 . NODE Foundation runs a digital art space in Palo Alto and a studio in Ne
 w York. WHO: anyone aged 18 or over.\n\nOrganisation: NODE Foundation\nLoc
 ation: NODE Studio NYC\, New York\, USA\, with a paid visit to NODE's head
 quarters in Palo Alto\, California. In person only. No nationality restric
 tion\, but residents must be based in New York and no visa sponsorship\, h
 ousing or relocation support is given.\nAward: USD 5\,000 monthly stipend 
 for five months (USD 25\,000 total\; a collective shares one stipend)\, a 
 dedicated workspace\, technical support\, and flights and lodging for a vi
 sit to the Palo Alto headquarters. Housing\, relocation\, local transport\
 , living expenses\, health insurance and visa sponsorship are not included
 . No application fee mentioned.\nDuration: Five months (start date not pub
 lished)\n\nMore: https://nodefoundation.com/program/whatif?utm_source=arti
 ficialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://nodefoundation.com/program/whatif?utm_source=artificialnouveaug
 rantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:NODE Studio NYC\, New York\, USA\, with a paid visit to NODE's hea
 dquarters in Palo Alto\, California. In person only. No nationality restri
 ction\, but residents must be based in New York and no visa sponsorship\, 
 housing or relocation support is given.
END:VEVENT
